# Additional entries for local.properties, beyond the sdk.dir Android Studio generates for you.
# To use:
#   1. Open the project in Android Studio at least once so local.properties exists (it creates
#      it automatically with sdk.dir set).
#   2. Append the line(s) below to your local.properties and fill in the value.
# local.properties is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# Precedence: API_BASE_URL env var (CI) > apiBaseUrl in local.properties (local dev). The build
# fails with a clear error if neither is set — see README.md > "Configure the API base URL".

apiBaseUrl=
